  one node per destination path no matter how many archives contributed an entry of
  that name. Exclusivity is an archive fact and it is established at STEP 14, from
  the archives. Saying otherwise would be exactly the inference P2 forbids, and it
  is the reason eight modules below still have no exclusive witness of either kind
  even though their descriptor node is plainly in the graph.

